' @test valid
' @role test
' @status stable
' @dialect en-standard
' @covers Op.Repeat
' @description REPEAT with count only (no UNTIL condition)

REPEAT 2

  THINK attempt
    GOAL <<
    Try to solve the problem.
    >>
    RESULT
    * solution: TEXT
  END

  WAIT
    ON ?attempt
  END

END

EXIT
